# Fieldplate needs no API keys. Everything runs locally.
# This file exists so the shape of the environment is documented.

# Optional: where the local corpus, register and plates live (default: ./data)
# FIELDPLATE_DATA=./data

# Optional stretch, not on the demo path: a cached rewrite of one quoted
# manual section. Leave unset to keep the product fully local.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
